							How should escort cards be arranged on the entrance table?
						</summary>
						<p class="font-body" style="margin-top: 0.75rem; line-height: 1.6; padding-left: 1rem; border-left: 3px solid var(--accent-blue); font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 0;">
							Always alphabetize escort cards strictly by last name (A–Z) rather than by table number. When guests enter the reception foyer, they know their own last name immediately, allowing them to locate their card in 5 to 10 seconds and preventing traffic jams at the ballroom doors.
